      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2019-june/q2",
      "question": "<p>A particle, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span>, moves with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span></p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, the particle is at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> and is moving with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span></p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=T\"></span> seconds, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving in the direction of vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=4\"></span> seconds, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Find the distance <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"AB\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
